      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِنَّهُ لَمَخِيلٌ لِلْخَيْرِ</span></b> , (K in this art.,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُخِيلٌ</span>,
(S in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خيل</span>,) <i>Verily he is adapted</i> or <i>disposed
by nature to good</i> [i. e. <i>to be,</i> or <i>to do,</i> or <i>to effect,</i> or <i>to produce, what is good</i>]. (S, K.) [See
